ical validity.\n- The potential for iterative testing and refinement based on initial findings.\n\n**Software Implementation**  \nVarious statistical software packages, such as Minitab, JMP, and R, provide tools for conducting Robust Parameter Design analyses, including capabilities for factorial design, ANOVA, and optimization.\n\n**Common Applications or Examples**  \nRobust Parameter Design is commonly applied in industries such as automotive, electronics, and consumer goods, where product performance is critical. Examples include optimizing the settings of manufacturing processes to ensure consistent product dimensions or improving the formulation of materials to enhance durability under varying environmental conditions.", "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "annotations": [], "audio": null, "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null}, "content_filter_results": {"hate": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "protected_material_code": {"filtered": false, "detected": false}, "protected_material_text": {"filtered": false, "detected": false}, "self_harm": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "sexual": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "violence": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}}}], "created": 1768462329, "model": "gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18", "object": "chat.completion", "service_tier": null, "system_fingerprint": "fp_f97eff32c5", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 742, "prompt_tokens": 318, "total_tokens": 1060, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": 0, "audio_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "rejected_prediction_tokens": 0}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": 0, "cached_tokens": 0}}, "prompt_filter_results": [{"prompt_index": 0, "content_filter_results": {"hate": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "jailbreak": {"filtered": false, "detected": false}, "self_harm": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "sexual": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "violence": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}}}]}, "inpu